Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.34,0:01:36.76,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Estive sempre sonhando
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.76,0:01:40.93,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Enquanto minhas esperanças despedaçadas atravessavam o tempo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.93,0:01:45.31,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Em busca de diferentes tipos de gentileza
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.31,0:01:51.07,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Olho para o céu e imagino seu sorriso
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.07,0:01:57.07,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Desde aquele dia vimos o mundo de forma diferente
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.07,0:01:59.82,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Meus sentimentos transbordam
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.82,0:02:05.70,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Para colocar sua confiança em alguém não é difícil
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.70,0:02:08.75,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Então, essas memórias me dizem
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.75,0:02:14.59,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Continuar por esta estrada escondida na luz e na sombra
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.59,0:02:17.68,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Todos esses sentimentos brilham
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.68,0:02:20.34,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Eu quero te proteger
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.34,0:02:26.06,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Abrace os laços que você sentir em seu coração
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.06,0:02:29.10,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}A hora de se levantar é agora
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.10,0:02:31.86,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Deixe sua tristeza de lado
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.86,0:02:34.73,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Duas almas vão em direção à verdade
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.73,0:02:37.45,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Procurando por aquele sorriso
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.45,0:02:44.41,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Esses sentimentos nos guiam em direção à verdade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Signs,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.30,0:22:17.77,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)\blur5}A lua se afasta durante o amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.77,0:22:24.40,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}escondendo-se na brilhante luz forte.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.40,0:22:30.70,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Minhas emoções dão voltas infinitas,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:37.83,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,800)\blur5}enquanto tento conectar um coração ao outro...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.67,0:22:53.30,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)\blur5\3c&H462870&}Uma oração distante...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.30,0:22:56.89,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H462870&}Se a paz em que acreditávamos fosse uma mentira
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.89,0:23:01.52,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H51AFC3&}enganarei meu coração com tudo que tenho
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.52,0:23:06.32,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}e vestirei a mim mesma com um fogo inspirador!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.32,0:23:09.74,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}O jardim da criação não causa mais que destruição
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.74,0:23:14.33,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}mesmo tendo uma espada de dois gumes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.33,0:23:19.14,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}continue lutando com tudo que tem...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.14,0:23:24.25,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,300)\blur5\3c&HB2B865&}Meu pequeno trapaceiro!
